{% comment %}
  Product FAQ — the mechanism only. No content ships with this.

  Reads product.metafields.custom.faq, a JSON metafield holding a list of
  question/answer pairs. The definition has to be created in the Shopify admin
  before anything can be entered; see setup/MAINTENANCE.md under "Product FAQ".

  Expected shape:

    [
      { "question": "How long does a course last?",
        "answer": "<p>Fourteen days. See our <a href=\"/pages/returns\">returns policy</a>.</p>" }
    ]

  FAILS CLOSED, deliberately, and in three ways:

    - Absent, empty, or not a list  -> renders nothing, emits no schema.
    - An entry missing either half  -> that entry is skipped, not half-rendered.
      A question with no answer is worse than no question, and FAQPage schema
      with an empty acceptedAnswer is invalid structured data.
    - Nothing to show                -> the whole section is omitted, not left as
      an empty heading.

  This matters more here than in most themes. FAQPage markup makes these answers
  eligible to appear directly in Google's results, detached from the page and from
  any surrounding context. On a pharmacy that is a higher bar than ordinary product
  copy, which is why the mechanism ships empty and the content needs pharmacist
  sign-off before anyone populates it.

  ANSWERS MAY CONTAIN HTML, so internal links work. Only staff with admin access
  can write a metafield, so this is the same trust level as a product description.
  The visible copy renders that HTML; the JSON-LD carries it json-encoded, which
  keeps the block valid whatever the punctuation.

  Renders as <details>/<summary>: keyboard-operable and screen-reader-announced
  with no JavaScript, and the answers stay in the DOM when collapsed, which is what
  makes them eligible for the rich result.

  Usage:
    {% render 'product-faq', product: product %}                  visible section
    {% render 'product-faq', product: product, scope: 'schema' %}  JSON-LD only

  Accepts: product (required), scope ('schema' for the JSON-LD, omit for markup)
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign faq = product.metafields.custom.faq.value

  assign pairs_count = 0
  if faq != blank and faq.size > 0
    for item in faq
      assign q = item.question | default: '' | strip
      assign a = item.answer | default: '' | strip
      if q != blank and a != blank
        assign pairs_count = pairs_count | plus: 1
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}

{%- if pairs_count > 0 -%}
  {%- if scope == 'schema' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- assign emitted = 0 -%}
    {%- for item in faq -%}
      {%- assign q = item.question | default: '' | strip -%}
      {%- assign a = item.answer | default: '' | strip -%}
      {%- if q != blank and a != blank -%}
        {%- if emitted > 0 -%},{%- endif -%}
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": {{ q | strip_html | json }},
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ a | json }} }
        }
        {%- assign emitted = emitted | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
  {%- else -%}
<section class="pfaq" aria-labelledby="pfaq-heading-{{ product.id }}">
  <h2 class="pfaq-heading" id="pfaq-heading-{{ product.id }}">{{ heading | default: 'Frequently asked questions' }}</h2>
  <div class="pfaq-list">
    {%- for item in faq -%}
      {%- assign q = item.question | default: '' | strip -%}
      {%- assign a = item.answer | default: '' | strip -%}
      {%- if q != blank and a != blank -%}
        <details class="pfaq-item">
          <summary class="pfaq-q">
            <span>{{ q }}</span>
            <svg class="pfaq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="pfaq-a">{{ a }}</div>
        </details>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
